  {
   "text": "If your brother sins against you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go and confront him privately",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just the two of you alone",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If he listens to your voice",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You have won your brother back",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where two or three are gathered",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In my name they find me",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am there among them",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Truly I tell you",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But if you will not listen",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Take one or two others",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let the matter be established",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "By the testimony of witnesses",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
